      <title>Pizza vending off to a rough start in Houston</title>
      <link>https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/pizza-vending-off-to-a-rough-start-in-houston/</link>
      <description>PizzaForno, a Canadian company known for its automated pizza vending machines, announced ambitious plans in 2022 to expand across Texas. The concept centered on fully automated kiosks capable of preparing a ready-to-eat pizza in under five minutes. Houston was expected to host about a dozen machines initially, with up to 50 additional locations possible under a development agreement.</description>
