      <title>New York law could require contraception vending on college campuses</title>
      <link>https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/new-york-law-could-require-contraception-vending-on-college-campuses/</link>
      <description>A proposed New York law, the Emergency Contraception Act, would require every campus in the State University of New York and the City University of New York systems to install at least one vending machine dispensing emergency contraception, according to a Spectrum News report. The bill has already passed the state Senate and is under consideration in an Assembly committee.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/new-york-law-could-require-contraception-vending-on-college-campuses/</guid>
