      <title>Japan</title>
      <link>https://www.vendingtimes.com/news/japans-vending-industry-shows-signs-of-softening/</link>
      <description>Japan is seeing a gradual decline in the number of vending machines, according to a Financial Times report. The nation currently has about 2.2 million beverage vending machines, which is 23% fewer than during the peak in 1985, according to the Japan Vending System Manufacturers Association.</description>
